  "description": "The removal of 6no. antennas (2no. at top height of 34.9m AGL, 2no. at top height of 31.4m AGL, 1no. at top height of 34.7m AGL and 1no. at top height of 32m AGL), the installation of 4no. antennas replaced at their existing locations (2no. at top height of 34.9m AGL and 2no. at top height of 31.4m AGL) on the existing support poles and 2no. antennas relocated to the plantroom roof (top height at 34.3m AGL) mounted on a new 7.5 m high tripod support pole. The work also includes the replacement of 15 ERS units with 12 ERS units, the installation of 1no. 300mm dish, and the upgrade of equipment within the existing cabinets together with associated development works.\n",
